{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对不起，我来迟了——」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3440", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜～♪」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0652", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天美羽学姐突然把大家召集到一起。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "下周就是学姐的毕业典礼了。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次要商量的事大家大概也都猜到了。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很抱歉在这么忙的时候还将大家叫过来」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3441", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天我有重要的事情要向大家说」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3442", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是关于新社团长的事吗？」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5200", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪说出了大家心中的疑问。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，都已经这个时候了，\\n　就由我来指定人选可以吗？」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "「嗯，都已经这个时候了，　就由我来指定人选可以吗？」", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3443", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当、当然可以……大家也都同意吧？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5201", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「同意，天羽学姐选出的社团长当然无可挑剔」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6669", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我也同意」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5394", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「假如安洁能有幸当选社团长，\\n　定要让这喵咪社成为世界闻名的\\n　狂野动物王国——」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": "「假如安洁能有幸当选社团长，　定要让这喵咪社成为世界闻名的　狂野动物王国——」", "plain_idx": 231, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3996", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，菜菜每天都要忙女仆的工作，\\n　我会尽量避开你的」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "「呵呵，菜菜每天都要忙女仆的工作，　我会尽量避开你的」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3444", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎会如此！美羽同学，您的这番厚意安洁心领了，\\n　但着实不必如此。安洁的动物王国……」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "「怎会如此！美羽同学，您的这番厚意安洁心领了，　但着实不必如此。安洁的动物王国……」", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3997", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来安洁是当不了社团长了。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过下任社团长是谁我大概心里有数。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾也同意让美羽学姐指定人选吗？」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5202", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，当然」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到我的回答，\\n纱凪点了点头后再次看向了美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "听到我的回答，纱凪点了点头后再次看向了美羽学姐。", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3445", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐微笑着看了看每个成员。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后迈出一步，\\n走向了我预料之中的下任社团长。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "然后迈出一步，走向了我预料之中的下任社团长。", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「下一任社团长交给纱纱可以吗？」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3446", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎……我、我吗？可是……」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5203", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是我再三考虑后的选择。\\n　想来想去还是纱纱你最合适」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": "「这是我再三考虑后的选择。　想来想去还是纱纱你最合适」", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3447", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你愿意接受吗？」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3448", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5204", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都接受了这个结果。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但纱凪却有些不安地看着我们。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要我来继承学姐的位置……\\n　我担心负担太重了」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "「要我来继承学姐的位置……　我担心负担太重了」", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5205", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我没办法做得像学姐那么完美」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5206", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然后副社团长就有新吾来担当可以吗？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3449", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学、学姐，我还没说完……」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5207", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我站到慌张的纱凪身边，轻轻地敲了下她的头。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了，这个社团和动物们就交给我吧，\\n　我会和大家一起努力保护它们」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": "「我知道了，这个社团和动物们就交给我吧，　我会和大家一起努力保护它们」", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，拜托你了♪」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3450", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等一下。\\n　我还没说要接受社团长的职位……」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "「等、等一下。　我还没说要接受社团长的职位……」", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5208", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管是谁都觉得纱凪最合适哦」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6670", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我也这么觉得」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5395", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天起就是纱纱动物王国了呢」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3998", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是、所以说——」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "「不是、所以说——」", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5209", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3451", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5210", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐握住了纱凪的手，看向她的眼睛。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3452", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她们之间会说些什么呢。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只知道纱凪是一副要哭出来的表情。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐依然保持着笑容。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3453", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的手动了。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后像往常一样，\\n她准备温柔地抚摸纱凪的头。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "然后像往常一样，她准备温柔地抚摸纱凪的头。", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但她在中途停下手，\\n收回了自己的胸前。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "但她在中途停下手，收回了自己的胸前。", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拜托你了，新吾」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3454", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为什么学姐没有摸纱凪的头呢？", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我试着凭自己的经验去理解。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐是想推纱凪一把。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "推这个没有自信的女孩一把。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已经不需要再将她当小孩子了。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算没有美羽学姐，\\n纱凪也依然能独立自主地走下去。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "就算没有美羽学姐，纱凪也依然能独立自主地走下去。", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐……我……」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5211", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3455", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一直微微低头的纱凪用力地握了握手，\\n然后看向了美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "一直微微低头的纱凪用力地握了握手，然后看向了美羽学姐。", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我会试试看，\\n　虽然我没有自信能成为像学姐一样优秀的社团长……」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "「我会试试看，　虽然我没有自信能成为像学姐一样优秀的社团长……」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5212", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但我会以我的方式努力」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5213", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3456", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到纱凪这么说，\\n学姐发自内心地笑了。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "听到纱凪这么说，学姐发自内心地笑了。", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢你，那就拜托你咯，纱纱」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3457", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯！」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5214", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都露出了微笑。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这里一直都是这样。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
